.TH BRENTS-TOASTS 1 "2026-08-04" "brents-toasts" "brents-toasts Manual"
.SH NAME
brents-toasts \- zero-dependency toast/snackbar UI library for JavaScript and TypeScript
.SH DESCRIPTION
brents-toasts is a framework-agnostic toast/snackbar library, distributed as an npm
package and used as a JavaScript import or a plain
.B <script>
tag. It is not a command-line tool, so there is no CLI usage to document here.
.PP
For installation instructions, API documentation, and usage examples, see the
resources below.
